{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMV0QYM4ZRBWN1V1327C","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMV0QYM4ZRBWN1V1327B","op":"create","set":{"body":"The v0.24.10 change review found a P0 in retention (archived items ping-pong back into done.jsonl), a merge gate that trusts commit statuses from any actor, and seven releases without regenerated design docs. Issues #412 and #413 add duplicate ticket creation on fresh clones and a request for CI-owned sync with Azure Pipelines support. This epic fixes all of it in one PR per workstream: retention, marker probe, gate hardening, PAT identity for bot PRs, CI sync, release gate, and an Azure template.","kind":"feature","level":"epic","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P1","status":"todo","title":"Fix the v0.24.10 review findings and close #412 and #413"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822T","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822S","op":"create","set":{"body":"Copy the plan to the scratchpad, run grok, codex, and a Fable 5.1 subagent as reviewers, let one Fable 5.1 editor subagent apply the worthy edits once, then capture the plan with plan-capture. The plan is not edited after capture.","kind":"feature","level":"task","parent":"01M2XCWMV0QYM4ZRBWN1V1327B","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P0","status":"todo","title":"Council review, single edit pass, and plan capture"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822W","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822V","op":"create","set":{"body":"done_state folds done and archive together, refreshed ids are pruned from the archive, and archive appends dedupe by item with the newest snapshot winning. Without this the archive ping-pongs forever and done.jsonl never shrinks. Must land before 2026-10-17.","kind":"feature","level":"task","parent":"01M2XCWMV0QYM4ZRBWN1V1327B","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P0","status":"todo","title":"Retention: stop re-snapshotting archived items into done.jsonl"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822Y","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822X","op":"create","set":{"body":"The FIFO cap currently counts archived items and evicts real ones once the archive exceeds the cap.","kind":"feature","level":"subtask","parent":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822V","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"Cap counts only items present in done.jsonl and unparseable ts never occupies a cap slot"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X8230","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822Z","op":"create","set":{"body":"A parent is never archived while a child remains in done or todo, and an already archived child does not hold its parent back. The roadmap and status reports keep the epic column.","kind":"feature","level":"subtask","parent":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822V","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"Parent veto in eviction, live children only"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X8232","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X8231","op":"create","set":{"body":"A garbage line in archive.jsonl must not crash the nightly job, even when no item is open. Negative, float, and nested config values print a warning instead of vanishing.","kind":"feature","level":"subtask","parent":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822V","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"Tolerate a corrupt archive line and warn on ignored retention config values"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X8234","git":"0c94b21","item":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X8233","op":"create","set":{"body":"Merge-check folds the archive so an archived owner still blocks a duplicate link, with the archive path inferred so callers do not change. An untracked archive.jsonl counts as dirty.","kind":"feature","level":"subtask","parent":"01M2XCWMVD7KJ01FCNEV1X822V","plan":"docs/plans/2026-09-19-review-v0-24-10-and-open-tickets.md","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"Archive-aware duplicate ownership check and untracked-archive guard"},"ts":"2026-09-19T17:54:39Z"}
